---
const arrow = `<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>`;
---

<section class="section vision" id="company" aria-labelledby="vision-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="lead reveal">
      <p class="label kicker">Company</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="vision-title">Building a different kind of company.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="essay">
      <p class="first reveal">
        We believe software can do more than support the people running a business. It can take part in running it.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        That means doing the work, learning from the results and getting better over time. Digit builds the technology
        behind that idea and puts it to work across the businesses we own and operate.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        The goal is companies that run with increasing autonomy, with people in control of the decisions that matter.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost cta reveal" href="/company">About Digit Software <Fragment set:html={arrow} /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vision {
    background:
      radial-gradient(700px 500px at 85% 40%, rgba(139, 123, 255, 0.07), transparent 70%),
      var(--bg-0);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .essay p {
    font-size: clamp(19px, 1.7vw, 22px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    max-width: 32em;
  }

  .essay p + p {
    margin-top: 1em;
  }

  .essay .first {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-stretch: 106%;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: 20em;
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
